{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"As you all begin climbing into the boat the fey speaks up again. “Right, now then! You all saw that tentacle a few minutes ago, which means you’re probably thinking about how you’re going to take such a huge beast down. The good news is that we don’t have to. In fact, unless you all are a hell of a lot stronger than you look, that’d be near impossible. What we do need to do is take care of the things attacking the giant squid. I’ve been assured from our Chinn friends here” The fey gestures to a group of Chinnookin standing in the shallows by the docks. “That should we deal with the beasts attacking our large friend here, they’ll be able to calm him down. The name’s Prosser, by the way.” The fey leaps down off the boxes in one smooth motion into the water below, before surfacing and climbing into one of the rowboats. As you all begin to depart along with the accompanying Chinnookin, they turn towards you all once more. “Those of you with heavier armor on, I highly recommend you take it off unless you fancy drowning.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T01:20:35.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865764890415988756","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"\"It appears so!\"\nHe helps up Sonny\n\"First time? You're a natural pilot, this should be much easier!\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T01:21:06.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865765023476219945","reply_to_id":"865764808452341790","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
